<title>RUSSIA: Russia's Samara region picks Goldman for Eurobond.</title>
<headline>Russia's Samara region picks Goldman for Eurobond.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Samara region mandated U.S. investment bank Goldman Sachs to lead-manage its first Eurobond, a regional administration official said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;We have appointed Goldman Sachs lead-manager,&quot; Financial Resources Department Head Yelena Timofeyeva told Reuters.</p>
</text>
